<title>USA: Merrill Lynch sets two-for-one stock split.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets two-for-one stock split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch and Co Inc said Tuesday it set a two-for-one common stock split.</p>
<p>The split will be effected in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend, payable May 30 to shareholders of record May 2, Merrill said.</p>
<p>The last stock split, also two-for-one, took place in the fourth quarter of 1993.</p>
